Package: gltbnn
Type: Package
Title: Variational Bayesian Neural Networks with Grouped Shrinkage Priors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Se Yoon", "Lee", email = "seyoonlee.stat.math@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fit Bayesian neural networks for Gaussian regression with
    global, grouped horseshoe, or global-local-tail shrinkage on the incoming
    weights and bias of each hidden unit. The global-local-tail model learns
    a separate tail shape for each hidden layer. Variational inference yields
    draws of the regression function and posterior predictive draws for new
    observations. The tail-adaptive prior builds on Lee et al. (2024)
    <doi:10.1214/24-EJS2317>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats
URL: https://yain22.github.io/Bayesian_NN_GLT/, https://github.com/yain22/Bayesian_NN_GLT
BugReports: https://github.com/yain22/Bayesian_NN_GLT/issues
